<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūlīgo</span></b> ,
		ĭnis, f.
		cf. fumus; v. Fick, Vergl. Wörterb. p. 104, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>soot.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os oblitum fuligine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 5, 4, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quasi fuligine abstersa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Phil. 2, 36, 91</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 3, 60</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 7,
				50</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lucubrationum bibenda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(haerens) nigro fuligo Maroni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					7, 227</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>black paint</i> (=
			stibium): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">supercilium madidā fuligine tactum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 2,
					93</span></i>
			.—*</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>paint</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">atra verborum et argutiarum fuligine ob oculos
					audientium jacta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					1, 2, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
